      "text": "May blunt the antihypertensive effect of ACE inhibitors. Raises lithium levels: watch for lithium toxicity. May enhance methotrexate toxicity. Interferes with aspirin's antiplatelet effect. With warfarin, GI bleeding risk is synergistic."
